# 20 - Testing readiness

## Goal
Add unit, widget, and integration test foundations.

## Applies app rules
- [`testing.md`](../.cursor/testing.mdc)
- [`ci_cd_quality_gates.md`](../.cursor/ci_cd_quality_gates.mdc)
- [`state_management.md`](../.cursor/state_management.mdc)
